<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n34406" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔμπληκτος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμπλήσσω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>stunned, amazed</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπὸ τῶν κυνῶν γενέσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Cyn.</u>
					5.9
				</span></i>
			: hence, <i>stupid, senseless</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔ. καὶ μανικός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Rom.</u>
					28
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Agath.
				3.24
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔμπληκτα ληρεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					8.693
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> in 
				Att.
			, <i>impulsive</i>: hence, <i>unstable,
			capricious</i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Aj.</u>
				1358
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>EE</u>
				1240b17
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἱ τύχαι, ἔ. ὡς ἄνθρωπος, ἄλλοτ᾽
					ἄλλοσε πηδῶσι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Tr.</u>
					1205
				</span></i>
			; [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ φιλοσοφία</span>] <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν ἑτέρων παιδικῶν πολὺ ἧττον
			ἔ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Grg.</u>
				482a
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. τε καὶ ἀσταθμήτους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Ly.</u>
					214d
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔ. ταῖς ἐπιθυμίαις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Dio</u>
					18
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τως</span>
			<i>rashly, madly</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Isoc.
				7.30
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ἐ. ὀξύ</span>
			<i>frantic</i> vehemence, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				3.82
			</span></i>; <i>foolishly</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				1.535
			</span></i>.</div>
